      "content": "a break doesn't really help tho. i sleep, i take time off, i try to distract myself... but i always wake up and it's just the same heavy feeling. it's like there's no version of this life that doesn't feel like this. it's just constant. it feels like i've fought as hard as i can and i'm still losing.",
